{"unit_id":"wwj-wwj1__dsh-device-link#card-zh","repo":"wwj-wwj1/dsh-device-link","commit":"e28ba7e67f0d6b4708deb3491a25345975e96b46","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-device-link（DSH 网页插件）：把本机 DSH 提供给同一局域网或 EasyTier 组网中的手机和其他设备访问。它在侧边栏提供设备互联面板，并通过宿主 webServer 注册状态、开关和配置接口；网关转发 HTTP 与 WebSocket 请求。主要功能包括分别控制局域网和组网入口、显示连接状态、生成 EasyTier 配置，以及在 Windows 上管理 EasyTier 服务。适合希望从另一台设备继续使用桌面 DSH 的用户。运行网关需要 Windows 与 Node.js 20 或更高版本；EasyTier 仅在使用组网入口时需要。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:384-402","lib/index.js:983-1056","lib/gate.cjs:189-229"]}
{"unit_id":"wwj-wwj1__dsh-device-link#card-en","repo":"wwj-wwj1/dsh-device-link","commit":"e28ba7e67f0d6b4708deb3491a25345975e96b46","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-device-link lets other devices access local DSH over LAN or EasyTier. Its sidebar controls the gateways and shows status. A local gateway forwards HTTP and WebSocket traffic. The panel also helps configure EasyTier. Requires Windows and Node.js 20+; EasyTier is optional for LAN use.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:384-402","lib/index.js:983-1056","lib/gate.cjs:189-229"]}
